{"total_count":341,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huggingface/transformers/commits/df04b012229d50d2b6dfba32c61c3057c3a40ea1","sha":"df04b012229d50d2b6dfba32c61c3057c3a40ea1","node_id":"MDY6Q29tbWl0MTU1MjIwNjQxOmRmMDRiMDEyMjI5ZDUwZDJiNmRmYmEzMmM2MWMzMDU3YzNhNDBlYTE=","html_url":"https://github.com/huggingface/transformers/commit/df04b012229d50d2b6dfba32c61c3057c3a40ea1","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huggingface/transformers/commits/df04b012229d50d2b6dfba32c61c3057c3a40ea1/comments","commit":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huggingface/transformers/git/commits/df04b012229d50d2b6dfba32c61c3057c3a40ea1","author":{"date":"2026-09-11T23:52:51.000+02:00","name":"Yih-Dar","email":"2521628+ydshieh@users.noreply.github.com"},"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T23:52:51.000+02:00","name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com"},"message":"[DeepseekV3] OOM cascade root-cause investigation (generator ref leak in conversion_mapping) (#48720)\n\n* [DeepseekV3] investigation placeholder: OOM cascade from generator ref leak in conversion_mapping.py\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* [DeepseekV3] free GPU memory after tests loading real checkpoint to prevent OOM cascade\n\n`test_eager_matches_sdpa_generate` loads two copies of `bzantium/tiny-deepseek-v3`\n(~10 GB each). When it OOMs during generation, the models are not freed before the\nnext test runs, causing a cascade of spurious OOM failures in the suite.\n\n- Wrap the generate loop in try/finally so `del model_eager, model_sdpa` +\n  `cleanup(gc_collect=True)` always runs, even when the test fails mid-way.\n- Add `del model` + `cleanup(gc_collect=True)` at the end of `test_compile_static_cache`.\n- Change `DeepseekV3IntegrationTest.tearDown` from `gc_collect=False` to `gc_collect=True`\n  so reference cycles are broken between integration tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* [DeepseekV3] add inline comments explaining cleanup rationale (see PR #48720)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* revert integration test changes (will use MemoryCleanupMixin in a follow-up)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* [DeepseekV3] update stale golden values in test_compile_static_cache\n\nThe expected strings went stale due to torch/env drift on CI runners.\nThe model (bzantium/tiny-deepseek-v3) is untrained so output is\ngibberish that changes across environments. Values refreshed from\nlatest main CI run (2026-09-11). See PR #48720.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* [DeepseekV3] add TODO on compiled static cache path (never passed since added)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: ydshieh <ydshieh@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huggingface/transformers/git/trees/920f5e2f2d4b80cee196d2199b65b9a2da4af2b2","sha":"920f5e2f2d4b80cee196d2199b65b9a2da4af2b2"},"comment_count":0},"author":{"login":"ydshieh","id":2521628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MjE2Mjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2521628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydshieh","html_url":"https://github.com/ydshieh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydshieh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydshieh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydshieh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydshieh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydshieh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydshieh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydshieh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydshieh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydshieh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"w